== 1. refusals
ok    a row without an answer: exit 3, nothing written
ok    answers not marked finished: exit 3, nothing written
ok    a fresh row without an answer: exit 3
ok    rows of the old form, with the generator's verdict: exit 3, nothing written
ok    answers of the old form (agree, disagree, unsure): exit 3, nothing written
== 2. a clean hand check
ok    all agreed, no fix, round 1 agreed: PASS, 0 of 100, no diff (exit 0)
== 3. a disagreement resolved and fixed
ok    PASS; error 1 of 100; fix abc123 listed; diff names g00 level 0 A2 (exit 0)
ok    the blind-only rate: 1 of the 98 rows the register does not list
ok    an error on a row the author had seen counts in the rate over all rows, not in the blind one (exit 0)
== 4. an unsure row
ok    resolved, generator right: not an error, denominator 100, apart from disagreements (exit 0)
ok    resolved, generator wrong: an error, reported as unsure, not as a disagreement (exit 0)
ok    unsure without a resolution: no verdict (exit 2)
== 5. incomplete resolutions
ok    no source line: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    an error without its commit: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    the fix not made (generator unchanged): no verdict (exit 2)
== 6. a fix that flips a row marked agree
ok    flipped agreed row without a resolution: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    resolved with the new verdict: PASS, listed, counted as an error (exit 0)
ok    resolved with the old verdict, a wrong fix: caught, no verdict (exit 2)
== 7. failure form (i)
ok    an unresolvable disagreement, no fresh round yet: FAIL (i), VOID at once (exit 1)
ok    the same in fresh round 1: FAIL (i) (exit 1)
== 8. failure form (ii)
ok    an error in round 1: first failure, read again on round 2 (exit 1)
ok    an error in round 2 too: second failure, VOID (exit 1)
ok    round 2 clean: PASS after the first failure (exit 0)
ok    a fresh disagree mark the source resolves for the generator: not a disagreement (exit 0)
ok    round 2 without a failure of round 1: no verdict (exit 2)
== 9. consistency
ok    no fresh round: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    fresh rows that are not the drawn games: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    answers kept against another rows file: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    no contamination register: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    rows that name no truth_blob: no verdict (exit 2)
ok    a fresh round with no pinned truth table: no verdict (exit 2)
OK
